{
  "duration": 46.619,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 1.419,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.979,
      "end": 4.299,
      "text": "It's time to solve one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.759,
      "end": 7.48,
      "text": "Now in this problem, we are given two tangent values."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.899,
      "end": 8.92,
      "text": "One is ten thirty degree,"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.359,
      "end": 10.84,
      "text": "the other is ten sixty degree."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.34,
      "end": 12.079,
      "text": "The question is"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.539,
      "end": 14.099,
      "text": "asking us to find their product."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.46,
      "end": 14.979,
      "text": "That means"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.519,
      "end": 19.139,
      "text": "we simply need to multiply ten thirty degree and ten sixty degree."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.84,
      "end": 21.219,
      "text": "Now we know the standard values."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.559,
      "end": 23.84,
      "text": "Ten thirty degree is equal to one by root three,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.319,
      "end": 26.319,
      "text": "and ten sixty degree is equal to root three."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.879,
      "end": 30.779,
      "text": "So their product becomes one by root three multiplied by root three."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.619,
      "end": 31.879,
      "text": "Here,"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.38,
      "end": 36.5,
      "text": "root three in numerator and root three in denominator will cancel,"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.959,
      "end": 38.119,
      "text": "so the answer becomes one."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.899,
      "end": 39.319,
      "text": "Hence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.899,
      "end": 43.719,
      "text": "the product of ten thirty degree and ten sixty degree is one."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.319,
      "end": 46.619,
      "text": "So the correct option is option D."
    }
  ],
